# Line endings are load-bearing here: span files are hashed byte-for-byte
# (manifest sha256s, Phase 3 golden tests, the Phase 5/6 evidence chain), so
# git must never translate them. Everything checks out as LF on every
# platform; the toolchain (Python, ruff, make) is LF-safe on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Hashed artefacts: no text processing at all.
*.jsonl -text
*.data -text
tests/golden/** -text
# Vendored OCEL 2.0 standard schemas: byte-identical to their published
# source (sha256s recorded in tests/fixtures/ocel2/README.md).
tests/fixtures/ocel2/** -text
